[
  // Cooking. Each meal is a *configuration* rather than an arbitrary recipe — protein,
  // vegetable, seasoning, liquid — and the ingredients decide what the meal carries: the
  // warming broth is warm because dried emberleaf went into it, not because a recipe said so.
  // `growth` is the recovery property that will make these healing consumables once the
  // consumable forms land; until then the reaction engine can eat them.
  //
  // Every input is another profession's output, which is the point (GDD §7.2).
